= Class Consciousness of the New Middle Class

Due to our investments in media, socialism is becoming more popular, including among the new middle class. [ ? if peoples_party==0: Marxist intellectuals have long debated about the status of the new middle class and whether they constitute a different class from the proletariat. ?][? If peoples_party==1: Despite becoming a people’s party, our party has traditionally prioritised the industrial working class. ?] Our propagandizing has meant that the new middle class are increasingly considering themselves part of the proletariat, or at least having more in common with them. Whilst they’re more moderate than the industrial proletariat, we could awaken their class consciousness as a way to expand the SPD’s base [? if peoples_party==0: without diluting its class character ?] and to build solidarity with all workers.

- @awaken: Awaken their class consciousness!
- @refute: No, we will not do this.
- @easy_discard_1: Return card to hand.
- @cancel_advisor_action

@easy_discard_1
view-if: last_advisor_action = 0
go-to: easy_discard

@awaken
choose-if: resources >= 1 or aufhauser_advisor or radio >= 2 or commercialized_media >=2
subtitle: [? if radio < 2 and not aufhauser_advisor : -1 resource. ?] [? if commercialized_media < 2 and not aufhauser_advisor : -1 resource. ?] [? if aufhauser_advisor : Aufhäuser can use the AfA-bund to do this. ?] [? if radio >= 2 : We can use our existing radio program for this. ?] [? if commercialized_media >= 2 : We can use our existing newspapers for this. ?] 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if radio < 2 and not aufhauser_advisor : -1 resource. ?] Consider hiring Aufhäuser, or expanding radio programs. [? if commercialized_media < 2 and not aufhauser_advisor : -1 resource. ?] Considering hiring Aufhäuser, or commercialising our newspapers.
on-arrival: new_middle_spd += 10*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 3; left_strength += 5; reformist strength += 5; labor_strength += 5; socialism += 4*(1-dissent); new_middle_conscious = 1

We have taken advantage of the situation, and have awoken the class consciousness of the white collar workers. Increasingly, they flock to our party.

@refute

We will not do this.
